# Postposed morning daypart words that keep a bare 12-hour clock reading in
# the AM half (meridiem offset 0), the am counterpart of
# clock_meridiem_pm.voc.  "klokken ni om formiddagen" == 09:00; only the noon
# edge is rewritten (12 -> 0).  Bands: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules,
# locale da -- morgen [05:00, 10:00) and formiddag [10:00, 12:00) are the am
# half.  ("natten" is NOT here: the night daypart crosses midnight -- see
# clock_meridiem_night.voc.)
morgenen
formiddagen
